@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion
state BlogsNewsUpdates
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state AddCase
state CaseDetails
state SetReminder
state UploadDocuments
state OnlineCollegeMagazineSystem
state LoginAttemptInvalid
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticles
state ProvideFeedback
state Logout

AccountCreation --* LoggedOut: Create Account
LoggedOut --> SignIn: Enter Password
SignIn --* LoggedOut: Check Password
LoggedOut --> WatchVideos: Watch Videos after Login
WatchVideos --> SaveVideo: Save Video in Likes List
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos: View Saved Videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion: Enter Discussion Option
BlogsNewsUpdates --* LoggedOut: Explore Blogs and News Updates
LoggedOut --> AccountCreation: Create Account by Providing Details
AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Check Provided Details
IncorrectDetails --> LoggedOut: Prevent Proceeding if Details are Incorrect
SignIn --> AccountCreation: Sign-in using Password after Creating Account
AddCase --* SignIn: Add a New Case
AddCase --> CaseDetails: Select Category and Enter Case Details
CaseDetails --> SetReminder: Set Reminders
SetReminder --> UploadDocuments: Upload Related Documents for Cases
Upon Logout: LoggedOut
@enduml
